---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// p12_drain.py captures: exec -> exit code 0 after 1.8 s with "Shutting down" in the
// log; shell (sh -c "... && uvicorn") -> exit code 137 after 5.3 s (docker stop -t 5)
// and no "Shutting down" line, because sh was PID 1 and uvicorn never got the signal.
const W = 900, H = 300;
---
<figure class="bep12g">
  <div class="bep12g-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two ways to start the container. With exec, uvicorn is process 1, receives SIGTERM, drains and exits with code 0 after 1.8 seconds. With a shell wrapper, sh is process 1, swallows SIGTERM, uvicorn never hears it, and after the 5 second timeout the container is killed with exit code 137 after 5.3 seconds. The shell row is drawn in red.">
    <text x="40" y="30" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>docker stop, same image, two ways to start it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>docker stop, cùng một image, hai cách khởi động</tspan></text>
    <g>
      <text x="40" y="76" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>exec uvicorn ...</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>exec uvicorn ...</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="96" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>uvicorn is PID 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>uvicorn là PID 1</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="58" width="130" height="46" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="315" y="86" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>SIGTERM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SIGTERM</tspan></text>
      <line x1="380" y1="81" x2="440" y2="81" class="line" />
      <polygon points="440,73 456,81 440,89" class="arrow" />
      <rect x="460" y="58" width="150" height="46" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x="486" y="81" size={22} />
      <text x="514" y="86" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>uvicorn, PID 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>uvicorn, PID 1</tspan></text>
      <line x1="610" y1="81" x2="660" y2="81" class="line" />
      <polygon points="660,73 676,81 660,89" class="arrow" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x="700" y="81" size={22} />
      <text x="726" y="78" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>exit 0</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>exit 0</tspan></text>
      <text x="726" y="96" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>after 1.8 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sau 1,8 s</tspan></text>
    </g>
    <g>
      <text x="40" y="196" class="t red"><tspan data-lang-en>sh -c "... &amp;&amp; uvicorn ..."</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sh -c "... &amp;&amp; uvicorn ..."</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="216" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>sh is PID 1, uvicorn is PID 6</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sh là PID 1, uvicorn là PID 6</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="178" width="130" height="46" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="315" y="206" text-anchor="middle" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>SIGTERM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SIGTERM</tspan></text>
      <line x1="380" y1="201" x2="440" y2="201" class="line" />
      <polygon points="440,193 456,201 440,209" class="arrow" />
      <rect x="460" y="178" width="150" height="46" rx="8" class="box bad" />
      <text x="535" y="206" text-anchor="middle" class="sm red"><tspan data-lang-en>sh, PID 1: ignores it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sh, PID 1: bỏ qua</tspan></text>
      <line x1="610" y1="201" x2="660" y2="201" class="line red-l" />
      <polygon points="660,193 676,201 660,209" class="arrow red-a" />
      <DiagramIcon name="fail" x="700" y="201" size={22} />
      <text x="726" y="198" class="t red"><tspan data-lang-en>exit 137</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>exit 137</tspan></text>
      <text x="726" y="216" class="sm red"><tspan data-lang-en>SIGKILL after 5.3 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SIGKILL sau 5,3 s</tspan></text>
    </g>
    <text x="40" y="270" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>the shell row never logged "Shutting down": uvicorn did not know it was being stopped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hàng shell không có dòng "Shutting down": uvicorn không biết mình đang bị dừng</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Docker waited 5 s here (docker stop -t 5). Kubernetes would wait 30 s by default, the same way, for the same reason.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ở đây Docker chờ 5 giây (docker stop -t 5). Kubernetes mặc định chờ 30 giây, theo cùng cách và cùng lý do.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12g { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12g-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12g svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep12g text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep12g .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep12g .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep12g .sm, .bep12g .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12g text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12g .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12g .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep12g .line { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep12g .line.red-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep12g .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep12g .arrow.red-a { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12g figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
